{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 12:42-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.AUTO-LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["ro"],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Dac\u0103 valoarea este selectat\u0103, \u00eencepe\u021bi s\u0103 introduce\u021bi o nou\u0103 valoare pentru a \u0219terge valoarea anterioar\u0103."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Atunci c\u00e2nd este selectat un num\u0103r (valoarea este afi\u0219at\u0103 invers), utiliza\u021bi tasta s\u0103geat\u0103 dreapta pentru a \u0219terge selec\u021bia f\u0103r\u0103 a \u0219terge valoarea. Apoi ap\u0103sa\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a edita."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["SUGESTIE: \u00cen general, este mai bine s\u0103 utiliza\u021bi tastele TAB sau SHIFT-TAB pentru a trece de la o intrare la urm\u0103toarea sau la cea anterioar\u0103."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["SFATUL 2: \u00cen general, editarea unei valori este ineficient\u0103. Deoarece valorile sunt selectate automat, tasta\u021bi pur \u0219i simplu num\u0103rul pe care \u00eel dori\u021bi."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Nu introduce\u021bi caracterul de separare a miilor."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Dac\u0103 utiliza\u021bi conven\u021bia SUA, aceasta ar fi virgula.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Sunt suficient de inteligent s\u0103 le introduc pentru dumneavoastr\u0103!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["S-a produs o eroare necunoscut\u0103 de calcul al datei."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 ne furniza\u021bi datele de intrare \u0219i set\u0103rile dvs., astfel \u00eenc\u00e2t s\u0103 putem remedia problema. V\u0103 mul\u021bumim."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data nu este valabil\u0103 - an gre\u0219it."],"Jan":["ian."],"Feb":["feb."],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Mai"],"Jun":["Iun"],"Jul":["Iul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sept"],"Oct":["Oct"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dec"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Eroare: datele nu se succed."],"Exception":["Excep\u0163ie"],"occurred when accessing":["a ap\u0103rut la accesarea"],"Invalid index":["Indice invalid"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Limita intern\u0103 a fost atins\u0103. Soldul dep\u0103\u0219e\u0219te +\/- 99 trilioane."],"YTD":["Cumul Anual"],"Running Totals":["Totale cumulative"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Graficul dvs. de \u00eemprumut personalizat"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Ultima rat\u0103 a sc\u0103zut cu"],"due to rounding":["din cauza rotunjirilor"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Ultima sum\u0103 de plat\u0103 a crescut cu"],"Auto Loan Summary":["Rezumat credit auto"],"Down Payment":["Avans"],"Loan Amount":["Suma \u00eemprumutului"],"Number of Payments":["Num\u0103rul de pl\u0103\u021bi"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Rata anual\u0103 a dob\u00e2nzii"],"Periodic Payment":["Plata periodic\u0103"],"Loan Date":["Data \u00eemprumutului"],"1st Payment Due":["Prima plat\u0103 datorat\u0103"],"Payment Frequency":["Frecven\u021ba pl\u0103\u021bilor"],"Last Payment Due":["Ultima plat\u0103 datorat\u0103"],"Total Interest Due":["Dob\u00e2nda total\u0103 datorat\u0103"],"Total All Payments":["Totalul tuturor pl\u0103\u021bilor"],"Auto Loan Payment Schedule":["Grafic de pl\u0103\u021bi pentru credit auto"],"Year":["Anul"],"Date":["Data"],"Payment":["Plat\u0103"],"Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103"],"Principal":["Principal"],"Balance":["Sold"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Metoda de calcul: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Principal total"],"Total Interest":["Dob\u00e2nda total\u0103"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Pct. din totalul pl\u0103\u021bilor"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Totaluri anuale principal \u0219i dob\u00e2nd\u0103"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Principal \u0219i dob\u00e2nd\u0103 acumulate cu sold restant"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Total principal \u0219i dob\u00e2nd\u0103"],"Loan":["\u00cemprumut"],"One of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment Amount\" or \"Loan Amount\" must be \"0\".":["Una dintre urm\u0103toarele: \u201ePre\u021b\u201d, \u201eValoarea Avansului\u201d sau \u201eSuma \u00cemprumutului\u201d trebuie s\u0103 fie \u201e0\u201d."],"You may use our general purpose loan calculator if you don't want to consider purchase price.":["Pute\u021bi utiliza calculatorul nostru de credite cu destina\u021bie general\u0103 dac\u0103 nu dori\u021bi s\u0103 lua\u021bi \u00een considerare pre\u021bul de achizi\u021bie."],"Only one of the following: \"Price\", \"Down Payment\" or \"Loan Amount\" can be \"0\".":["Doar una dintre urm\u0103toarele: \"Pre\u021b\", \"Avans\" sau \"Suma \u00eemprumutului\" poate fi \"0\"."],"There are too many unknown values.":["Exist\u0103 prea multe valori necunoscute."],"Auto Loan Calculator Help":["Ajutor pentru calculator credit auto"],"<p>Use this calculator to calculate loan details when the down payment is expressed as an amount.<\/p>":["<p>Utiliza\u021bi acest calculator pentru a calcula detaliile \u00eemprumutului c\u00e2nd avansul este exprimat ca sum\u0103.<\/p>"],"<p>Unlike a general loan calculator, this calculator allows for two unknown values. In addition to solving for the monthly payment amount, it will also calculate the \"Car Price\", the \"Down Payment Amount\" or the \"Loan Amount\". Just enter a \"0\" (zero) for one of the three values and provide the other two.<\/p>":["<p>Spre deosebire de un calculator general de \u00eemprumuturi, acest calculator permite dou\u0103 valori necunoscute. Pe l\u00e2ng\u0103 calcularea sumei pl\u0103\u021bii lunare, va calcula \u0219i \u201ePre\u021bul Ma\u0219inii\u201d, \u201eValoarea Avansului\u201d sau \u201eSuma \u00cemprumutului\u201d. Introduce\u021bi doar \u201e0\u201d pentru una dintre cele trei valori \u0219i furniza\u021bi celelalte dou\u0103.<\/p>"],"<p>Note that the calculator calculates what percentage the down payment is of the price of the car. This is handy when a lender requires a borrower to provide a minimum percentage cash deposit.<\/p>":["<p>Re\u021bine\u021bi c\u0103 calculatorul calculeaz\u0103 ce procent reprezint\u0103 avansul din pre\u021bul ma\u0219inii. Acest lucru este util atunci c\u00e2nd un creditor solicit\u0103 \u00eemprumutatului un depozit minim \u00een numerar.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Perioada (durata) \u00eemprumutului este exprimat\u0103 \u00een num\u0103r de luni.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 luni = &nbsp;5 ani<\/li><li>120 luni = 10 ani<\/li><li>180 luni = 15 ani<\/li><li>240 luni = 20 ani<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 luni = 30 ani<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need the ability to print the amortization schedule, or more flexibility such as selecting different payment or compounding frequencies or the ability to calculate term or interest rate, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Dac\u0103 ave\u021bi nevoie de posibilitatea de a tip\u0103ri graficul de amortizare sau de mai mult\u0103 flexibilitate, cum ar fi selectarea diferitelor frecven\u021be de plat\u0103 sau de capitalizare, ori de capacitatea de a calcula termenul sau rata dob\u00e2nzii, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 consulta\u021bi calculatorul credit auto aici: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you want to set the loan closing date and first payment due date; select different payment or compounding frequencies; the ability to calculate term or interest rate; or the ability to export the schedule to Excel or Word, please see the auto loan calculator here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Dac\u0103 dori\u021bi s\u0103 seta\u021bi data \u00eenchiderii \u00eemprumutului \u0219i data scaden\u021bei primei rate; s\u0103 selecta\u021bi frecven\u021be diferite de plat\u0103 sau capitalizare; s\u0103 calcula\u021bi termenul sau rata dob\u00e2nzii; sau s\u0103 exporta\u021bi graficul \u00een Excel sau Word, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 consulta\u021bi calculatorul de credite auto aici: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/auto-loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Monthly":["Lunar"],"Your Personalized Car Loan Schedule":["Graficul dumneavoastr\u0103 personalizat de \u00eemprumut auto"],"Prepared for":["Preg\u0103tit pentru"],"Address":["Adres\u0103"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ora\u0219, Jude\u021b, Cod po\u0219tal"],"Prepared On":["Preg\u0103tit la"],"Prepared by":["Preg\u0103tit de"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Site web"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 folosi\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Tastele s\u0103geat\u0103 st\u00e2nga, sus \u0219i jos sunt dezactivate. La fel \u0219i tastele home, end, pgup \u0219i pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Folosi\u021bi backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"Unknown":["Necunoscut"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datele trebuie s\u0103 fie prima zi a lunii."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un obiect de dat\u0103 JavaScript nevalid."]}}}